start":220,"end":224,"surface":"胡白題將","kind":"person","person_id":"3ul_r7s_sou","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"引用漢事的一位將領；不當白題國，也不把白題解為已確定個人諱。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0227","start":227,"end":229,"surface":"服虔","kind":"person","person_id":"rxm_wwu_6ns","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0244","start":244,"end":248,"surface":"漢定遠侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"後漢047明班超封定遠侯，後漢088八滑擊北虜事件之將卻為班勇；銜/事件衝突未解，不任連班超、不造第三人。","candidate_person_ids":[]},{"id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye:p004:m0251","start":251,"end":253,"surface":"八滑","kind":"person","person_id":"h8q_tj4_cxf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"後漢088明勇率加特奴及八滑、八滑為後部親漢侯，同一擊北虜事件；梁之滑國後裔僅推測，不能建祖系。"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye","book_id":"b-liangshu-030","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liang030-ws1508510"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao:p004","unit_id":"xietiao-main:u004","text":"建武四年出為晉安王鎭北諮議南東海太守行南徐州事啟王敬則反謀上甚嘉賞之遷尚書吏部郎朓上表三讓中書疑脁官未及讓以問祭酒沈約約曰宋元嘉中范曅讓吏部朱脩之讓黄門蔡興宗讓中書竝三表詔答具事宛然近世小官不讓遂成恒俗恐此有乖讓意王藍田劉安西竝貴重初不自讓今豈可慕此不讓邪孫興公孔顗竝讓記室今豈可三署皆讓邪謝吏部今授超階讓别有意豈關官之大小撝謙之美本出人情若大官必讓便與詣闕章表不異例既如此謂都非疑朓又啟讓上優答不許","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","source_position":{"first_line":218,"last_line":229,"revision_id":"787dd9a7da495542e8f17c26c96900ce37b2c211","source_layer":"received_chapter","raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/nanqi047-xietiao/projection.json","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao:p004:m0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"晉安王","kind":"person","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_A","status":"contextual_provisional","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi047-jinan","resolution_note":"依完整本傳、引語層與逐項固定來源判讀；不依名字字串全域替換。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao:p004:m0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"王敬則","kind":"person","person_id":"w3c_uh3_9up","status":"contextual_provisional","ident